ror path right after 892/896 (cleanup), and 908 is… maybe inside the \"unlink\" helper called from unregister.\n\nLet me grep for the function name around there. Candidates: \"typec_plug_plug\"? Let me grep \"static void typec_\" and list the functions that come after line 683:"}}
